From 015ed46154b51be7563f0332d7768c8dc236f470 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Jonas=20=C3=85dahl?= <jadahl@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Jan 2026 11:17:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/22] Allow configuring RDP authentication mechanism

This currently is a useless configuration, since it only allows setting
'credentials' (meaning username/password combination), but it's meant to
be preparatory plumbing for adding Kerberos authentication.

It's currently only added for the single user headless mode, and
screen share mode.

Part-of: <https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-remote-desktop/-/merge_requests/369>
---
